1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,426
Empat puluh laga,

2
00:00:01,462 --> 00:00:02,680
empat puluh menang,

3
00:00:02,685 --> 00:00:04,213
tiga puluh tujuh lewat KO.

4
00:00:04,403 --> 00:00:05,734
Juara ini belum pernah kalah,

5
00:00:05,734 --> 00:00:07,855
sampai suatu subuh di Afrika.

6
00:00:07,855 --> 00:00:08,639
Ini AUDIRA.

7
00:00:08,939 --> 00:00:12,694
Kinshasa, Zaire, tiga puluh Oktober sembilan belas

8
00:00:12,884 --> 00:00:13,808
tujuh puluh empat.

9
00:00:13,998 --> 00:00:16,300
George Foreman, dua puluh lima tahun,

10
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,847
juara dunia kelas berat.

11
00:00:18,037 --> 00:00:19,446
Penantangnya Muhammad Ali,

12
00:00:19,446 --> 00:00:21,004
tiga puluh dua tahun,

13
00:00:21,194 --> 00:00:23,419
yang gelarnya dicabut tujuh tahun sebelumnya.

14
00:00:23,609 --> 00:00:25,555
Bursa taruhan menjagokan Foreman,

15
00:00:25,745 --> 00:00:26,917
empat banding satu.

16
00:00:27,217 --> 00:00:29,647
Laga sempat ditunda lebih dari sebulan karena

17
00:00:29,647 --> 00:00:31,531
mata Foreman robek saat sparing.

18
00:00:31,721 --> 00:00:33,791
Lalu digelar sekitar jam empat pagi,

19
00:00:33,857 --> 00:00:36,500
supaya tayang di jam utama televisi Amerika.

20
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:38,873
Hampir enam puluh ribu orang memenuhi stadion,

21
00:00:38,873 --> 00:00:40,654
meneriakkan satu kalimat: Ali,

22
00:00:40,654 --> 00:00:41,500
bomaye!

23
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:42,800
Ali, bunuh dia!

24
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,550
Tapi Ali tidak menyerang.

25
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,609
Ia bersandar di tali ring yang kendur

26
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,486
dan membiarkan Foreman memukul,

27
00:00:48,486 --> 00:00:49,488
ronde demi ronde.

28
00:00:49,678 --> 00:00:51,174
Penonton mengira Ali menyerah.

29
00:00:51,364 --> 00:00:52,737
Padahal itu jebakan,

30
00:00:52,742 --> 00:00:53,882
namanya rope-a-dope.

31
00:00:53,965 --> 00:00:56,282
Setiap pukulan menguras tenaga Foreman sendiri.

32
00:00:56,582 --> 00:00:57,567
Ronde delapan.

33
00:00:57,757 --> 00:00:59,099
Foreman mulai limbung.

34
00:00:59,289 --> 00:01:01,126
Ali melepas rentetan pukulan,

35
00:01:01,316 --> 00:01:03,138
dan sang juara tak terkalahkan roboh.

36
00:01:03,328 --> 00:01:05,015
Wasit menghitung sampai sepuluh,

37
00:01:05,015 --> 00:01:06,574
dua menit lima puluh delapan detik.

38
00:01:06,764 --> 00:01:08,632
Tak lama, fajar menyingsing,

39
00:01:08,822 --> 00:01:10,861
lalu badai hujan deras mengguyur stadion.

40
00:01:11,161 --> 00:01:13,081
Ali merebut kembali gelar juara dunia kelas

41
00:01:13,081 --> 00:01:13,648
berat.

42
00:01:13,838 --> 00:01:16,233
Kadang, cara menang adalah bertahan paling lama.

43
00:01:16,423 --> 00:01:18,074
Episode berikutnya di AUDIRA,

44
00:01:18,172 --> 00:01:20,303
fakta olahraga yang lebih gila lagi.

45
00:01:20,417 --> 00:01:21,372
Ikuti terus.
